        "description": "Security Agent VPC configuration allows unrestricted egress. The agent can reach any external endpoint.",
        "action": "Restrict egress security group rules to only the endpoints required for pentest target communication. Remove 0.0.0.0/0 outbound rules and replace with specific CIDR blocks or security group references for the target infrastructure.",
        "example": "{\n  \"network\": {\n    \"vpc_config\": { \"has_unrestricted_egress\": false }\n  }\n}\n"
